 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg3-00",
   "text": "先看第一处，熵不足。攻击路径有四步。",
   "spoken": "先看第一处，熵不足。攻击路径有四步。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg3-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 4.896,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 5.683
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-01",
   "text": "第一，生成器用了状态很小的伪随机数生成器，比如只用 32 位种子初始化的 mt19937。",
   "spoken": "第一，生成器用了状态很小的伪随机数生成器，比如只用 32 位种子初始化的 MT 一九九三七。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg3-01.mp3",
   "start": 6.716,
   "dur": 9.024,
   "speechStart": 6.814,
   "speechEnd": 14.897
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-02",
   "text": "第二，种子只有约 43 亿种，私钥也就只有约 43 亿种。",
   "spoken": "第二，种子只有约 43 亿种，私钥也就只有约 43 亿种。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg3-02.mp3",
   "start": 15.96,
   "dur": 5.496,
   "speechStart": 16.058,
   "speechEnd": 20.629
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-03",
   "text": "第三，攻击者在 GPU 上枚举全部种子，算出对应的地址。",
   "spoken": "第三，攻击者在 GPU 上枚举全部种子，算出对应的地址。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg3-03.mp3",
   "start": 21.676,
   "dur": 6.024,
   "speechStart": 21.774,
   "speechEnd": 26.869
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-04",
   "text": "第四，和链上有余额的地址比对。命中，就转走资产。",
   "spoken": "第四，和链上有余额的地址比对。命中，就转走资产。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg3-04.mp3",
   "start": 27.92,
   "dur": 6.312,
   "speechStart": 28.018,
   "speechEnd": 33.384
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-05",
   "text": "看起来随机，不等于安全。私钥必须来自 CSPRNG，也就是密码学安全随机数生成器，满 256 位熵。",
   "spoken": "看起来随机，不等于安全。私钥必须来自 CSPRNG，也就是密码学安全随机数生成器，满 256 位熵。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg3-05.mp3",
   "start": 34.452,
   "dur": 9.696,
   "speechStart": 34.55,
   "speechEnd": 43.309
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-06",
   "text": "三个案例，走的都是这条路。",
   "spoken": "三个案例，走的都是这条路。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg3-06.mp3",
   "start": 44.368,
   "dur": 3.096,
   "speechStart": 44.466,
   "speechEnd": 46.644
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-07",
   "text": "第一个是 Profanity。1.60 及以前的版本只用 32 位种子。",
   "spoken": "第一个是 Profanity。1.60 及以前的版本只用 32 位种子。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg3-07.mp3",
   "start": 47.684,
   "dur": 6.048,
   "speechStart": 47.782,
   "speechEnd": 52.886
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-08",
   "text": "2022 年 9 月 15 日，1inch 公开披露。5 天后，Wintermute 被盗。同期还有多个受害者。",
   "spoken": "2022 年 9 月 15 日，1inch 公开批路。5 天后，Wintermute 被盗。同期还有多个受害者。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg3-08.mp3",
   "start": 53.952,
   "dur": 8.352,
   "speechStart": 54.05,
   "speechEnd": 61.476
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-09",
   "text": "第二个，Trust Wallet 浏览器扩展。Wallet Core 的 WASM 版本生成助记词，用的是 mt19937，熵从 256 位降到 32 位。",
   "spoken": "第二个，TrustWallet 浏览器扩展。WalletCore 的 WASM 版本生成助记词，用的是 MT 一九九三七，熵从 256 位降到 32 位。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg3-09.mp3",
   "start": 62.524,
   "dur": 12.744,
   "speechStart": 62.622,
   "speechEnd": 74.429
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-10",
   "text": "受影响的，是 2022 年 11 月 14 日到 23 日新建的扩展钱包。Ledger 的安全团队报告后，几天内就修复了。",
   "spoken": "受影响的，是 2022 年 11 月 14 日到 23 日新建的扩展钱包。Ledger 的安全团队报告后，几天内就修复了。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg3-10.mp3",
   "start": 75.488,
   "dur": 9.936,
   "speechStart": 75.586,
   "speechEnd": 84.583
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-11",
   "text": "但部分弱钱包后来还是被盗，损失约 17 万美元，Trust Wallet 承诺补偿。",
   "spoken": "但部分弱钱包后来还是被盗，损失约 17 万美元，TrustWallet 承诺补偿。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg3-11.mp3",
   "start": 85.644,
   "dur": 6.888,
   "speechStart": 85.742,
   "speechEnd": 91.694
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-12",
   "text": "第三个，Libbitcoin Explorer 的 Milk Sad 漏洞。它生成种子的命令，用的是一个 32 位的时间值。",
   "spoken": "第三个，LibbitcoinExplorer 的 MilkSad 漏洞。它生成种子的命令，用的是一个 32 位的时间值。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg3-12.mp3",
   "start": 92.752,
   "dur": 8.04,
   "speechStart": 92.85,
   "speechEnd": 99.954
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-13",
   "text": "2023 年 7 月 12 日发生集中盗取，损失至少约 90 万美元。",
   "spoken": "2023 年 7 月 12 日发生集中盗取，损失至少约 90 万美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg3-13.mp3",
   "start": 101.012,
   "dur": 6.456,
   "speechStart": 101.11,
   "speechEnd": 106.622
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-14",
   "text": "厂商认为，文档早有警告。",
   "spoken": "厂商认为，文档早有警告。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg3-14.mp3",
   "start": 107.688,
   "dur": 3.48,
   "speechStart": 107.786,
   "speechEnd": 110.321
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-15",
   "text": "教训有三条。在 WASM 或 JS 里替换随机源，要单独审计。",
   "spoken": "教训有三条。在 WASM 或 JS 里替换随机源，要单独审计。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg3-15.mp3",
   "start": 111.388,
   "dur": 6.6,
   "speechStart": 111.486,
   "speechEnd": 117.15
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-16",
   "text": "文档里的警告挡不住误用，生成密钥的接口必须默认安全。",
   "spoken": "文档里的警告挡不住误用，生成密钥的接口必须默认安全。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg3-16.mp3",
   "start": 118.208,
   "dur": 5.688,
   "speechStart": 118.306,
   "speechEnd": 123.044
  },
  {
